# --max-diagram-height with Pele: the tall diagram shows smaller than its natural size, so
# Pele offers its zoom controls
@ source mermaid-tall.md
@ mermaid pele
@ height 200
+ --mdr-diagram-max-height: 200px;
=1 max-width: min(100%, calc(var(--mdr-diagram-max-height) * 0.
+ class="pele pele-zoom"
